@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Santé
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Toutes les ruches
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives

### Ruches d'un site
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives?site_id=SN-CASA

### Une ruche
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001

### Ruche inconnue (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/XX-NOPE-999

### Nouvelle mesure (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001/measures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hive_id": "SN-CASA-001",
  "site_id": "SN-CASA",
  "timestamp": "2026-10-31T10:00:00Z",
  "position_lat": 12.5743,
  "position_lon": -16.2873,
  "weight_kg": 36.84,
  "temp_internal_c": 34.4,
  "temp_external_c": 27.1,
  "humidity_pct": 64,
  "acoustic_activity_score": 0.42,
  "battery_pct": 88
}

### Mesure sans timestamp (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001/measures
Content-Type: application/json

{ "weight_kg": 36.84 }

### Mesure de 500 kg, hors plage (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001/measures
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timestamp": "2026-10-31T10:00:00Z", "weight_kg": 500 }

### Mesure avec une humidité hors plage (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001/measures
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timestamp": "2026-10-31T10:00:00Z", "weight_kg": 36.84, "humidity_pct": 120 }

### Mesure sur une ruche inconnue (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/XX-NOPE-999/measures
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timestamp": "2026-10-31T10:00:00Z", "weight_kg": 36.84 }

### Mesure avec un JSON mal formé (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001/measures
Content-Type: application/json

{ "weight_kg":

### Historique des mesures (première page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001/measures

### Historique des mesures (page suivante)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001/measures?limit=50&offset=50

### Historique, limit trop petit (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001/measures?limit=0

### Historique, limit trop grand (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001/measures?limit=501

### Historique, limit pas un nombre (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001/measures?limit=abc

### Historique, offset négatif (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001/measures?offset=-1

### Historique d'une ruche inconnue (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/XX-NOPE-999/measures

### Inspections d'une ruche
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-001/inspections

### Inspections d'une ruche inconnue (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/XX-NOPE-999/inspections

### Nouvelle inspection, UUID neuf à chaque envoi (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-003/inspections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{$guid}}",
  "inspected_at": "2026-11-13T09:00:00Z",
  "colony_status": "forte",
  "queen_present": true,
  "observations": "Bonne activité."
}

### Inspection en double (201 la première fois, 409 ensuite)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-003/inspections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "0b6c4a0e-6f1f-4d8e-9a2b-3c4d5e6f7a8b",
  "inspected_at": "2026-11-13T09:00:00Z",
  "colony_status": "normale"
}

### Inspection sans UUID valide (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-003/inspections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "abc",
  "inspected_at": "2026-11-13T09:00:00Z",
  "colony_status": "forte"
}

### Inspection avec un colony_status inconnu (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/SN-CASA-003/inspections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{$guid}}",
  "inspected_at": "2026-11-13T09:00:00Z",
  "colony_status": "super"
}

### Inspection sur une ruche inconnue (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hives/XX-NOPE-999/inspections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{$guid}}",
  "inspected_at": "2026-11-13T09:00:00Z",
  "colony_status": "forte"
}

### Route inconnue (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nope
